        <briefdescription>
<para>Create a calibration from factory path. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The calibration is created from a factory path, containing the license and calibration file &quot;init.daq&quot; as well as further calibration files (e.g. SpRad.cu3).</para>
<para>The calibration is lazy-loading, i.e. the <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1AcquisitionContext" kindref="compound">AcquisitionContext</ref> and the <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1ProcessingContext" kindref="compound">ProcessingContext</ref> will only be initialized, when explicitly called.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>do not load multiple calibration instances of the same camera</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">path</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The path to the factory directory </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
